<title>USA: ITC says names Stevens president.</title>
<headline>ITC says names Stevens president.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITC Learning Corp said Monday it named its chief operating officer Carl Stevens as president, replacing Steven Roden.</p>
<p>Roden resigned as president of ITC Learning Corp but will continue at the request of the board to serve as a director, ITC said.</p>
<p>ITC develops and markets workplace learning products for business, education and government.</p>
